The third wireframe is displaying the course view and assessments view that is tied to each course. 
There were slight changes done to this part of the app. The view of assessments was moved into the course editor, 
to increase simplicity. Buttons such as "add assessment" and "edit assessment" were added into the 
course editor so the user can easily add or modify assessments. The user interface to edit assessments 
remained mostly the same, all the functionalities remained, there was only a slight interface change that 
made the view look nicer.